{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00451","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黄帝宫音 雍和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 黄帝宫音 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金县夕肆，玉俎朝陈。\n飨荐黄道，芬流紫宸。\n乃诚乃敬，载享载禋。\n崇荐斯在，惟皇是宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}